n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.50<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 7, 2014<br/>Summer Update 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20141206023547&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Voting_Results_6e8878.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  the voting results.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">This board will notify you of all relevant voting results, courtesy of the Rathleton Magistrate.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Rathleton%20Magistrate\">Rathleton Magistrate</a> entrance floor (+2), near <a href=\"#/wiki/Marvin\">Marvin</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Ezebeth\">Ezebeth</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>When used, it will print information about what the citizens of Rathleton voted on; related to the <a href=\"#/quest/rathleton-quest\">Rathleton Quest</a>.<br/><br/>Possible messages are:\n</p>\n<ul><li><i>The citizens of Rathleton voted for the shortcut back from the &lt;minotaurs/fungi/catacombs&gt;.</i> — Which Oramond hunting area will have an active shortcut back to town.</li>\n<li><i>The citizens of Rathleton voted for the &lt;golems/minotaurs/wrath of evil&gt; in the dungeon.</i> — Which group of creatures will populate the <a href=\"#/wiki/Oramond%20Dungeon\">Oramond Dungeon</a>.</li>\n<li><i>The citizens of Rathleton voted for &lt;Bullwark/Lisa/Glooth Fairy&gt;.</i> — Which Boss can be fought in the sewers: <a href=\"#/wiki/Bullwark\">Bullwark</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lisa\">Lisa</a>, or the <a href=\"#/wiki/Glooth%20Fairy\">Glooth Fairy</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/rathleton-quest\">Rathleton Quest</a></li><li>Utilities</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["rathleton-quest"]}